# The image needs six things; everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
!resources
!docker

# Your data and secrets are never baked into the image — they live in the
# folder you mount at /data. These are the git-ignored personal files, listed
# again here because a build context is not a git checkout.
.env
resources/candidate_profile.json
resources/candidate_data.json
resources/pers_preferences.md
resources/candidate_signature.png

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
